%% Schema v1 runtime import and encode ordering sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor App as Application
  participant API as Public runtime or codec API
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Codec as CodecBoundary
  participant Schema as Schema v1 validators
  participant Import as SchemaV1ImportSink
  participant DecodeSink as CanvasDocument builder sink
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Diagnostics as DiagnosticsHub

  App->>API: runtime.edits.loadDocumentFromJson(json)
  API->>Runtime: installLoadedDocument(json)
  Runtime->>Codec: importSchemaV1DocumentFromJsonIntoIsolatedSink(json, sink)
  Codec->>Codec: canonical reader raw JSON length check
  Codec->>Codec: canonical reader JSON parse

  alt raw length or parse fails
    Codec->>Diagnostics: create codec diagnostic with code, path, and sanitized details
    Diagnostics-->>Codec: record if enabled; keep original exception unchanged
    Codec--x Runtime: throw CanvasDataException
    Runtime--x API: throw CanvasDataException without cleanup or install
    API--x App: throw CanvasDataException
    Note over Codec,Store: Raw boundary failure emits no import events and mutates no runtime or store state.
  else raw input accepted
    Codec->>Codec: canonical reader root object check
    Codec->>Schema: schemaVersion gate(read exactly {1})
    Schema->>Schema: known v1 field validation and unknown non-metadata policy
    Schema->>Schema: primitive validation(colors, finite numbers, ids)
    Schema->>Schema: resource validation(appKey source only)
    Schema->>Schema: element validation(known kinds, enums, and transform admission)
    Schema->>Schema: layer and node count checks
    Schema->>Schema: metadata validation(JSON-only bounded extension area)

    alt codec validation accepts
      Schema-->>Codec: validated streamable import facts
      Codec->>Import: begin document and emit resource/layer/element events
      Import->>Store: prepareSchemaV1Import
      Store->>Store: duplicate id and cross-row reference checks
      alt store preparation accepts
        Store-->>Runtime: PreparedStoreDocumentImport consume-once rows
        Runtime->>Runtime: prepared interaction cleanup before install
        Runtime->>Store: install prepared rows atomically
        Runtime-->>API: publish one post-install state
        API-->>App: load accepted
      else store preparation rejects
        Store--x Runtime: CanvasDataException from prepared-row admission
        Runtime->>Codec: recordSchemaV1FailureDiagnostic(error)
        Codec->>Diagnostics: create codec diagnostic with sanitized details
        Diagnostics-->>Codec: record if enabled; keep original exception unchanged
        Codec-->>Runtime: return the same CanvasDataException
        Runtime--x API: throw CanvasDataException without cleanup or install
        API--x App: throw CanvasDataException
      end
    else schema validation rejects
      Schema->>Diagnostics: create codec diagnostic with code, path, and sanitized details
      Diagnostics-->>Codec: record if enabled; keep original exception unchanged
      Codec--x Runtime: throw CanvasDataException
      Runtime--x API: throw CanvasDataException without cleanup or install
      API--x App: throw CanvasDataException
    end
  end

  App->>API: decodeSchemaV1Document / decodeSchemaV1DocumentFromJson(input)
  API->>Codec: explicit schema v1 decode request
  Codec->>Codec: canonical reader traverses schema v1 input
  Codec->>DecodeSink: emit dependency-neutral import events
  DecodeSink-->>Codec: materialized CanvasDocument DTO
  Codec->>Codec: decoder-owned duplicate/reference validation
  Codec-->>API: CanvasDocument
  API-->>App: decoded public DTO

  App->>API: encodeCanvasDocument / encodeCanvasDocumentToJson(document)
  API->>Codec: encode request
  Codec->>Schema: validate contracts/public DTO before writing JSON

  alt DTO validation accepts
    Schema-->>Codec: public DTO accepted
    Codec->>Codec: canonicalize default fields
    Codec->>Codec: preserve layer/resource/element order
    Codec->>Codec: write uppercase color hex
    Codec->>Codec: write schemaVersion = 1 and all common element fields
    Codec->>Codec: omit nullable optional family fields only where schema allows
    Codec->>Codec: write appKey resource descriptors only
    Codec->>Codec: project CanvasMetadata as JSON-compatible values
    Codec->>Codec: omit unknown non-metadata fields from canonical encode
    Codec-->>API: canonical schema v1 JSON-compatible Map or JSON string
    API-->>App: encoded Map or JSON string
  else DTO validation rejects
    Schema->>Diagnostics: create codec diagnostic with sanitized path/details
    Diagnostics-->>Codec: record if enabled; keep original exception unchanged
    Codec--x API: throw CanvasDataException
    API--x App: throw CanvasDataException
  end

  Note over Runtime,Store: Runtime load uses import events and store rows; explicit decode uses the same reader but a codec-local DTO builder sink, never the runtime load route.
